# Native driver libraries owned by this module (one -l basename per line;
# blank lines and '#' comments are ignored). zanc discovers this file to bundle the
# driver on --publish; see src/compiler/main.c (zan_discover_drivers).
#
# "<lib> if <symbol-prefix>" = run-time loaded driver: Ort dlopens it
# (Interop.Load("onnxruntime.dll")) instead of declaring [DllImport], so it
# never appears among the linked libs and is bundled only when the image
# actually contains the Ort wrapper code (any Ort* symbol).
onnxruntime if Ort
